r the public to understand what  happened and why it is a source of great  dismay to us when we're accused of  hiding behind the confidentiality law  once the American people are able to be  made aware that this is going on  I think that that will be a real step  forward toward making sure that there's  accountability and that the agency is  ultimately working towards keeping  families together rather than separating  right now we're coming back to a normal  life  and I hope it's gonna be everything like  ending soon here so we're gonna have our  lives back like they've been put forth  right  [Music]  you

